(142, '98d71850-e14d-4ebf-b263-8bc752846d2d', '', '', '', 10, 'Komodo', '2H Holy Parry Tank (Rogue/Paladin/Warrior)', '', '### OVERVIEW\nThis build is braindead easy to play - Figure it out.', 'Ability_Paladin_ArtofWar', 0, 1785994901, 1785994901, 2, 8, 0, 0, 0),
(143, '1d006166-15a1-4534-945a-640e601420b1', '', '', '', 10, 'Tyranastros', 'Tyr\'s Holy Nova Spam', '', '### OVERVIEW\nA fairly braindead hybrid healer build for leveling via MS and Dungeons.\nOverall, this build serves as an off-healer that provides continuous flow of modest AoE healing. However, it\'s not great. A shaman healing build easily beats this out with Healing Rain + Chain Heal. It can perform diret heals just fine, but might struggle a bit in dungeons with a wall-to-wall pulling tank.\n\nDual wielding and attacking in melee allows for self-sustained mana regen from Spellblade and Seal of Wisdom.\nCan spam Holy Nova for AoE healing on melee as well.\nJudgement of Wisdom for some extra mana regen.\n\nAdditional AoE healing options available:\n• Prayer of Preservation\n• Lightwell\n• Divine Star\n• Holy Nova / Circle of Life\n• Tyr\'s Deliverance\n• Beacon of Virtue to spread single-target healing\n\nSingle-Target Healing:\n• Power Word: Shield + Renew\n• Penance for strong focused burst heals.\n• Flash of Light', 'ability_evoker_timelessness', 1, 1786002624, 1786390849, 1, 4, 4, 0, 1),
(144, '54936560-5bac-4ad8-a7a2-6a73dc97aaa8', '', '', '', 10, 'Haruka', 'Shield Tank - Raid/M+', '', '### OVERVIEW\nDefensive Stance got gutted, MfB is dead, Frost Presence is too new to work. While everyone plays Dark Apo or Bear tanks, I can\'t settle for those cheap tactics.\nSo I experimented, and experimented. Then I noticed a crucial difference between all the other Tank Stances and Righteous Fury... the ability to block Fierce Blows, the only thing Shield Tanks excel at was missing from Defensive Stance and isn\'t baked into Frost Presence either.\n\nAnd I thought... Paladin Tanks were always OP in WoTLK.\n\nSo I made this build.\n\n### PROS_AND_CONS\n|cff1aff1a+Self Healing|r\n+Great Raid and M+ tank\n+Not boring like Dark Apo or Bear\n\n-Can run out of mana\n-Squishy without the right gear\n\n### ITEMIZATION\nGenerally, you want Block Paladin Tank Gear\n\nStamina>Block Value>Block Rating=Strength>Intellect>SP=AP\n\n### ROTATION\nHoly Shield, Hammerstorm,  Hammer of Righteousness and Judgement of Wisdom on CD, use Light of the Guardian as filler\n\nSpend Crimson Champ stacks on Shield of Righteousness for ST, Judgement of Wisdom on AoE Packs\n\n### CONSUMABLES\nEnchants:\nStamina and Strength\n\nConsums:\n|cff0070dd|Hitem:967456:0:0:0:0:0:0:0:60|h[Distilled Flask of the Unyielding]|h|r\n|cff0070dd|Hitem:967522:0:0:0:0:0:0:0:60|h[Fused Rock\'s Stew]|h|r\n\n### MACROS\n{HT}showtooltip\n/castsequence reset=6 Holy Shield, Judgement of Wisdom, Hammerstorm, Light of the Guardian, Hammer of the Righteous, Shield of Righteousness\n/petattack [combat]\n/petpassive [nocombat]\n\n### NOTES\nWhile I picked Path of Intellect, you can use Strength, Int or Duality. I personally only use it for Spell Damage which equals more aggro. Don\'t go into Path of Healing it reduces your threat generated marginally.\n\nThe Strength to Block Value conversion from Path of Strength is miniscule enough where it won\'t matter which Path you run.\n\nFeel free to experiment with changing stuff around.', 'ability_paladin_shieldofvengeance', 2, 1786023801, 1787317455, 2, 2, 3, 0, 1),
(145, '99aa0930-ce34-4591-9ebd-d3d192448ed2', '', '', '', 10, 'Lazaleth', 'a build? for me?', '', '### OVERVIEW\ni needed somewhere to note', 'spell_frost_freezingbreath', 0, 1786045916, 1786045916, 1, 8, 1, 0, 0),
(146, '416ce5b0-9a8a-48d2-bb29-5ce226ce1932', '', '', '', 10, 'Idum', 'Idum\'s Frozen Stalker', '', '### OVERVIEW\nFrozen Stalker is a Frost archer build..\nCombination of Froststrike archer shots and Instand Frost Spells.\n\nit\'s a rater dificult build where you need to controll your mana, with Arcane Concentration, Viper\'s Sting and Aspect of the Viper stance dance.\n\nA fast range attack percfectly for single targets with the Frozen Orb Buff increasing your range speed with 30%, lowering the cooldown with your hunter shots so thos buff never go\'s down.\nArrow of Frost, is an important Mystic Enchant, dealing additional frost damage just by playing, but drains your mana fast thats why Mana Controll is needit with this build.\n\n### PROS_AND_CONS\n|cff1aff1a+Good AoE and Single Target attack|r\n+Controll support\n+Able to kite-tank (i found out in Dg\'s\n\n-Mana depletion happens fast\n-Almost no melee skills\n-Max range requirement 25 yards\n\n### ITEMIZATION\nHit Rating 14% (-1% Heroic Presence, -3% Carefull Aim) -> Attack Power -> Critical Strike Rating -> Agility -> Intellect -> Haste Rating (a bit not much gain +30% from Frozen Orb)\n\n### ROTATION\nMake sure ARROW OF FROST and Right Aspect is on.\n\nSingle Target\n----------------\nAffect the target with FROST FEVER with ICY TOUCH, \nEvery time FROZEN ORB is of cooldown cast it for haste buff.\nShoot a VIPER STING at high mana targets to sustain your own mana.\nDEEP FREEZE when off cooldown and FINGERS OF FROST proc.\nFill up with FROSTBOUND SHOT and FROST SHOT.\nChange ASPECT to VIPER when below 20% mana, rechange at 70%.\n\nAoE Targets.\n----------------\nThe only change here is ICY TOUCH is replaced with GLACIAL SPIKE to inflict AoE FROST FEVER.\nYour Shots will cast BLACK ICE AMMONITION more ofthen that does AoE Shadowfrost damage.', 'Ability_Hunter_LongShots', 4, 1786055063, 1786299442, 1, 8, 1, 0, 2),
(147, '4e984511-614e-416e-8c9c-74cb4bfecd7d', '', '', '', 10, 'Khari', 'Dk Shield Tank High Avoidances', '', '### OVERVIEW\nDK Shield Tank, using blood presence- righteous fury - Aspect of the monkey- devotion aura- frost armor- demon skin- blessing of sactuary- spike reinforcement are the buff. if you fallow these talents with ther heriloom gear i had high avoidance 50-60 with holy shield i pushed avodance over 100% currently at lvl 60 with 6 peaces of heriloom gear the rest rares with 1 epic i have armor 60.33 reduction Def rating 88 Dodge 37.22 Parry 15.01 Block 27.32/ HolyShield 57.32 if you find ways to improve this build give me a heads up hope this build helps anyone wanting to tank.\n\n### PROS_AND_CONS\nFun and easy to stay alive with subpar heals\n\n### ITEMIZATION\n|cffe6cc80|Hitem:3148685:928:0:0:0:0:0:0:60|h[Burnished Breastplate of Might]|h|r|cffe6cc80|Hitem:1339087:1889:0:0:0:0:0:0:60|h[Strengthened Cloak of Might]|h|r|cffe6cc80|Hitem:1339081:0:0:0:0:0:0:0:60|h[Ring of the Bulwark]|h|r|cffe6cc80|Hitem:1339105:1887:0:0:0:0:0:0:60|h[Burnished Boots of Might]|h|r|cffe6cc80|Hitem:1339119:1843:0:0:0:0:0:0:60|h[Burnished Platelegs of Might]|h|r|cff0070dd|Hitem:13204:1897:0:0:0:0:0:0:60|h[Bashguuder]|h|r|cff0070dd|Hitem:1261564:1704:0:0:0:0:13259:0:60|h[Swift Golden Buckler of Quick Defense]|h|r|cff0070dd|Hitem:515414:0:0:0:0:0:0:0:60|h[Libram of Ancient Warding]|h|r|cff0070dd|Hitem:11811:0:0:0:0:0:15275:0:60|h[Smoking Heart of the Mountain of Swift Might]|h|r|cff0070dd|Hitem:11302:0:0:0:0:0:0:0:60|h[Uther\'s Strength]|h|r|cff0070dd|Hitem:2065773:0:0:0:0:0:0:0:60|h[Girdle of Molten Vigilance]|h|r|cffa335ee|Hitem:313072:1887:0:0:0:0:0:0:60|h[Stonegrip Gauntlets]|h|r|cff0070dd|Hitem:18351:927:0:0:0:0:0:0:60|h[Magically Sealed Bracers]|h|r|cff0070dd|Hitem:410129:0:0:0:0:0:0:0:60|h[Argent Sentry Pauldrons]|h|r|cff0070dd|Hitem:13091:0:0:0:0:0:0:0:60|h[Medallion of Grand Marshal Morris]|h|r|cff0070dd|Hitem:11746:0:0:0:0:0:0:0:60|h[Golem Skull Helm]|h|r\n\n### ROTATION\n|cff71d5ff|Hspell:20928|h[Holy Shield]|h|r|cff71d5ff|Hspell:49896|h[Icy Touch]|h|r|cff71d5ff|Hspell:49917|h[Plague Strike]|h|r|cff71d5ff|Hspell:50842|h[Pestilence]|h|r|cff71d5ff|Hspell:48887|h[Blood Boil]|h|r|cff71d5ff|Hspell:907465|h[Glacial Smash]|h|r|cff71d5ff|Hspell:20928|h[Holy Shield]|h|r|cff71d5ff|Hspell:903194|h[Obliterating Ice]|h|r|cff71d5ff|Hspell:904564|h[Wendigo Bite]|h|r|cff71d5ff|Hspell:913207|h[Frost Siphon]|h|r|cff71d5ff|Hspell:20928|h[Holy Shield]|h|r\n\n### CONSUMABLES\n|cffffd000|Henchant:20023|h[Enchanting: Enchant Boots - Greater Agility]|h|r|cffffd000|Henchant:20012|h[Enchanting: Enchant Gloves - Greater Agility]|h|r |cffffd000|Henchant:13941|h[Enchanting: Enchant Chest - Stats]|h|r|cffffd000|Henchant:20031|h[Enchanting: Enchant Weapon - Superior Striking]|h|r|cffffd000|Henchant:16651|h[Blacksmithing: Thorium Shield Spike]|h|r|cff71d5ff|Hspell:54446|h[Rune of Swordbreaking]|h|r\n\n### NOTES\nnone', 'ability_ardenweald_warrior', 0, 1786057714, 1786057714, 2, 2, 0, 0, 0),
(148, 'b02c9044-4f26-432c-adb0-25a1ae3fb001', '', '', '', 10, 'Tulslaeh', 'Tuls\' SoE - Raid Edition', '', '### OVERVIEW\nSteward-ish. Always be casting.\n\nEdit 2026 - 08 -18 : Missile Barrage now has innate Align proc chance, and Align was removed from Impeccable Timing enchant, replaced with Tyrs CDR\n2026 - 08 - 24 : Time-Bind is fixed, build adjusted to match.\n\nTotemless Sub-build swaps:\nShaman talents -> Holy priest Talents\nTyrs Enchant - > Light of Life Halo CDR\nPick up Lightwell, Refilling the well enchant, and Guardian spirit along with its enchant.\n\n### PROS_AND_CONS\n|cff1aff1a+ Considerable Direct and Smart Heal overlap\n+ Plenty of swap outs for overlap with other members of raid team\n+ flexible points in 3 classes that all have good utility\n\n- you are a turret, your 2 main spells are not instant cast\n- down abyssmal for mana\n- no absorbtion or passive heal\n\n### ITEMIZATION\nSpell power > crit/haste > Spirit (if you stick with molten armor and maintain the mage mastery) > spirit/int\n\n### ROTATION\nSynchronize every 3 seconds >  maintain prayer of Mending if raid wide damage is occuring > align\n\n### NOTES\nCreated under the limitations of requiring Cleaning Totem, Tremor Totem, Bloodlust and Mass Dispell.\nCurrent extreme mana usage compensated for through abilities, which should be subbed out for more throughput (straight spell power, crit/haste, or spirit talents) as level of gear improved.\n\nThere is some wiggle room in the points used for abilities, but I strongly discourage deviating too much from the talent lay out. Shaman even without the totem requirments provides 280 spellpower via earth living, and coupled with priest (which you need for borrowed time) covers your dispells. Dropping 3 points out of Mage (netherwind presence) could be done, but losing 9% haste on a build that focuses so much on cast time would need a very strong off set to be worth while.', 'spell_azerite_essence_15', 2, 1786071533, 1787604871, 2, 4, 4, 0, 2),
(149, '61ef920f-3d52-49b5-87d3-fd13d0b7c9d4', '', '', '', 10, 'Tattitinka', 'Tinker Tailor Collective', '', '### OVERVIEW\nHaving some fun, messing around.', 'ability_domination_rune11', 0, 1786087123, 1786087123, 1, 8, 0, 0, 0),
