(153, '787eab64-9f48-4ff9-8d8e-c26dee5c28e4', '', '', '', 10, 'Djukka', 'Melee Enhancement Moonkin', '', '### OVERVIEW\nMelee Enhancement Moonkin\n\n### WEAKAURAS\n!WA:2!TZ1wSTXv6zRWnPPSTBLLDYUwnD3tyw7LQHMRSCKtSJLJ5njrlksTKuw2ztk5qohYzIgoZKzgQBjB31QbPgnPDle2EhOlGkqb6EPTqDX(CQFBF7aHI9L2II1pKx2w0cd036d9))CMz4qksBV2sjTfuqGCMZ1)Z)9Z58boY1hZEVPJp15Ipfjj1rASwJjpM8T)I7xtQ(QYwgMPm0mSUwOqHwk0KXN(U1mSKPwjDR0C0KAQBTLKLmPSHHMJQ5Uog1xJAzRAO)0R9g7l12rXWQGPd8UD47i6DHgnSPo)I1eVPSR47mYnPMhV0B3wYIsMTTMgzffvh6Uw0MqNlVPjTytlJ2MUnVK6w0N0CuBfO5YZAj1IMJUgvR6EIQfK9iJmsiRneZ38FuIF6p7PFVFLN3AtVcQ8R(uR(u67zjvNtFxOOTJKLt4Anu1vTvcNe(Yj82owQnBclPXpJL7JV)UY0ATB0ajkR5ZKBPzxoxshKcLABjn122MunTSY2HVRD7AavP7ucAT6g7vjvIsLRuQCIILt2gg8AMAsBsT8B2swuOzflTuMC5kYlP28ujnhLI6Wc0o8oT1DjHW7jPxhyTlzOcnkvM8LZu8EWJulDjTRlea)GI21L0OH2rsxTLeUeVa7eZEhQKnTKJfvVPJYVaB8K6g609LbchBrfCzyztRBOlBVn2uCrYoBYwsQ6ZYIbDGDwwC2xHnj89j7TKiQY7xyDn7vv1tPi54S5o2uTgCIKfTOKMPIuO7jOCUmdh8ALsvmtM8UcUS6GOjuny(BO2m8EnWwbuRKJuODb2urU2GD49u1ByyjwvH3fPwvHowsndj5lKeeb1F2ITAd6KHlwxtY2(zzVw4K2Gwd(WuTvL3BEvJLE7fMBdR1Ypw9x)2NExvyCkz02Qo95ogB05VAIel8V(g)t)d7jj)wTTDOYlkTXt05fv9NGD85V6w)Z)lV8377yW(YSO3PoyeiBSUoQlRKehUQSN9ZEg2N72JYoDyGr9Rz12MMhwsv3bvv4s1XnhDo1goeJgehfkzfvnz2xKr2hwC1vO2LumwVG((28Vwu12wvVj7fyFj2ZZIyoMAtDdlAAvByU0P1b6Q6DHPyo0sPsDdqFrH9CH31Tzuj5QMNOzNklacBjhdRXUm2RfXz0Rx)6SVa7ZZof7mHnpoAGSgTSq1Brdz63)ySj(b310YOPf12wWZ(nEUJ9eSxevX4AeGIHNAY5oqjNS3salkBjhujKQWU0LEw247dsB0jesT6Y3(eMJ5q3WPcyWdC4BimHhX8u8c5Fi0hQy7(a7S74xxKtBBoAGU3X7WDfL6PKMmXYLlyEcEHGVldubR(kQYokjtaVEpXePUbvMx4T2xOlFtxY5o86r9d1gBYIYg3cweyz7YROUNV0q74sX6oMJoRL6wKVABjzujNuUCxluVrEFEzRdMiRyjzU9kUpiMW1uTvRPrREhb1uXexkMhpB(8zkwjzHYLlSyXSZnF599Nv075PCj(B01uG1Y9Rvy5Y5YMpZhVFtnJ1N1I(2TP613CPpZKXNAAXcdR4o4hPDDEeAB8nS37xRTJJHEbiua4HBxS4CChopZE4ZERQDWx8JWe6oOMRxjk8w6rCjXxu4TVe3PgNSkROwFvDqdmeVMCQWZhNpBjfXwQPqvBQ4Cl2mZUlm4GeOvnjq5(kOta2v5FMa)0CuO6eUM2ClDLElsvxH9lXMVyhP42E27vzJb69HzpZz2r2OsDOhgTQwt89gJ8nuBq0nCiOfFfQ(AXfmh0Axpmb(R3kMHKYIcwcCxKr5nb)lssE1rI5xIUQwNx8hfreZovePeTEBlAcEuoXyuM2cc94qJ