(164, 'a6fc6828-c8c4-4229-8f15-11b9fbf3a7ab', '', '', '', 10, 'Insomni', 'Thunder Seer Arcane', '', '### OVERVIEW\nReally Simple build. mainly revolves around 4 spells.\nArcane Missiles, Lightning Bolt (Thunder Bolt from ME), Arcane Barrage (for time bomb CD reduction), and Starburst ME.\n\nOkay ST. Good AoE.\n\n### PROS_AND_CONS\n|cff1aff1a+Good AoE|r\n+ Simple to play\n\n- Average ST\n\n### ITEMIZATION\nSpellpower > crit >= haste\n\n### ROTATION\nST: Arcane missiles > Spam Thunderbolt During channel > Arcane Barrage at end (for passive CD reduction on time bomb). Repeat.\n\nAoE: Arcane Explostion x 3 > Starburst. repeat. (chain lighting at times gives 3 stacks. you can weave in if desired.\n\nUse CDs as seen fit. Time bomb on priority target.\n\n### CONSUMABLES\nhavent tested much so far. aim for higher spell power though.', 'ability_siege_engineer_magnetic_lasso', 0, 1786224056, 1786224056, 2, 8, 3, 0, 1),
