(180, '283419be-1188-4cb0-98de-49ed4c303fd3', '', '', '', 10, 'Zar', 'Dps solo MS', '', '### OVERVIEW\ngod build\n\n### PROS_AND_CONS\ngoD\n\n### ITEMIZATION\nkeki\n\n### ROTATION\nspam aoe + melee one handed\n\n### CONSUMABLES\nnop\n\n### MACROS\nx\n\n### WEAKAURAS\ndo it yourself!!\n\n### NOTES\nkeki', 'ability_boss_kilrogg_heartseeker', 0, 1786367360, 1786367360, 2, 8, 0, 0, 4),
