(184, '48358128-40e0-4b18-88e8-8074670eb53b', '', '', '', 10, 'Beefjurky', 'Elbow - Head Hunta', '', '### OVERVIEW\nWhat if the hoplite was a throwing spec?\nTrying to port over some of that CoA magic by mixing Hoplite + Zandalari glaive enchants, creating a rogue-warrior hybrid that deals damage at range.\n\n### ROTATION\nZandalari Glaive if fully stacked Master of Kunai\nBone Spear if available\nJavelin if off CD and we have 5 stacks of Phalanx\nLoa\'s Assault if: not enough energy OR 5 stacks of phalanx, but no Javelin CD (filler move)\nShuriken Toss + Deadly Throw as basic combo point builder + spender (also gets stacks of phalanx)\n\nPhalanx thrust/Bloodthirst/Sinister strike for melee range (+ it heals)', 'ability_racial_wardoftheloafire', 1, 1786393269, 1786754361, 1, 8, 1, 0, 0),
(185, '83ef109d-9e91-4431-acae-230e4c4f84de', '', '', '', 10, 'Flurky', 'Elbow - Flame Murloc', '', '### OVERVIEW\nSome kind of murloc fire mage', 'ability_evoker_terroroftheskies', 1, 1786394839, 1786394839, 1, 8, 0, 0, 0),
