(246, '9df900db-7fb1-4597-9114-8b20e7bb74d2', '', '', '', 10, 'Gandonio', 'harbi', '', '### OVERVIEW\n7.7k ST 62 ilvl\n\n### PROS_AND_CONS\n|cff1aff1a+ not gear dependent at all|r\n|cff1aff1a+ very easy to play|r\n+ lots of free ability essence\n+ bomboclat\n\n- cant die while actively trying to troll\n\n### NOTES\nswap malediction to nature\'s reach for ms/aoe', 'Ability_Hunter_Pet_Gorilla', 0, 1786913169, 1787415257, 2, 8, 3, 0, 0),
