(254, 'baea3bbd-a1b1-45c0-9e59-f93164a6ce93', '', '', '', 10, 'Idum', 'Idum\'s Frost Witch', '', '### OVERVIEW\ntest', 'ABILITY_MAGE_INVISIBILITY', 1, 1786987199, 1786988038, 1, 4, 4, 0, 0),
(255, 'aa7c14e4-4a54-4070-9cb6-27147e5158cf', '', '', '', 10, 'Nawxi', 'Molten Earth [WIP]', '', '### OVERVIEW\nMolten earth / Explosive trap for massive fire ae damage (8k dps with my actual gear)\n\nmono dps isn\'t gerat\n\nI\'m still working on this build but it does decent damage as it is\n\n[Edit]\nChanging Doomhammer\'s Fury forLeader of the Elements / Fire Elemental glyph for perma Elemental\n\n[Edit 2]\nChanging some spells to take Tether Elemental to replace imp / best synergy with Leader of the Elements\nIt doesn\'t change your dps drasticaly which elem you take but Boiling Flame seems to be the best option\n\n### PROS_AND_CONS\nNearly similar dps results with Intel or Duality\n\n[edit]\nAfter multiple tests, Int seems to be slightly higher in dps\n\n### ITEMIZATION\nI\'d say mail or leather gear with agi/int if you play duality\nor cloth if you play int\nWe love crit\n\nMy current gear (not BIS):\n|cffa335ee|Hitem:99706:0:0:0:0:0:0:0:60|h[Bloodmail Coif]|h|r\n|cffa335ee|Hitem:216972:0:0:0:0:0:0:0:60|h[Star of Mystaria]|h|r\n|cffa335ee|Hitem:248695:0:0:0:0:0:0:0:60|h[Cyclone Spaulders]|h|r\n|cffa335ee|Hitem:19870:0:0:0:0:0:0:0:60|h[Hakkari Loa Cloak]|h|r\n|cffa335ee|Hitem:19828:0:0:0:0:0:0:0:60|h[Zandalar Augur\'s Hauberk]|h|r\n|cffa335ee|Hitem:227590:0:0:0:0:0:0:0:60|h[Necropile Cuffs]|h|r\n|cffa335ee|Hitem:18808:0:0:0:0:0:0:0:60|h[Gloves of the Hypnotic Flame]|h|r\n|cffa335ee|Hitem:247425:0:0:0:0:0:0:0:60|h[Eyestalk Cord]|h|r\n|cffa335ee|Hitem:227064:0:0:0:0:0:0:0:60|h[Skullsmoke Pants]|h|r\n|cffa335ee|Hitem:227507:0:0:0:0:0:0:0:60|h[Bloodmail Boots]|h|r\n|cffa335ee|Hitem:19905:0:0:0:0:0:0:0:60|h[Zanzil\'s Band]|h|r\n|cffa335ee|Hitem:260814:0:0:0:0:0:0:0:60|h[Rune Band of Wizardry]|h|r\n|cff0070dd|Hitem:1513968:0:0:0:0:0:0:0:60|h[Time-Lost Relic]|h|r\n|cff0070dd|Hitem:1513965:0:0:0:0:0:0:0:60|h[Time-Lost Pocket Watch]|h|r\n|cffa335ee|Hitem:122775:0:0:0:0:0:0:0:60|h[Mastersmith\'s Hammer]|h|r\n|cffa335ee|Hitem:226628:0:0:0:0:0:0:0:60|h[Bonechill Hammer]|h|r\n|cffa335ee|Hitem:276133:0:0:0:0:0:0:0:60|h[Idol of Lunar Apparitions]|h|r\n\n### ROTATION\nAoe : Kepp up Magma totem and Explosive trap and spam the macro\n\nmono : keep up Searing totem and Immolation trap and spam macro\n\nUse Flametongue weapon on both weapons\n\n[edit]\nif you play with leader of the elements glyph, always use fire elemental totem when you can\nWith LL and SS reducing the cd of elemental totem, you should have it up before it despawn ilf the fight is long enough\n\n### MACROS\nmain macro :\n\n{HT}showtooltip\n/castsequence reset=8 Lava Lash, Fire Nova,Flame Shock,Lava Burst,Lava Lash,Salamander Bite,Fire Blast,Stormstrike\n/cast Flamebound Cleave\n/cast Flame Talon\n/cast Shamanistic Rage\n/cast Flame Ascendance\n/petattack\n\n\nMacro if you play with Boiling Flame as your elem :\n\n{HT}showtooltip\n/castsequence reset=8 Lava Lash, Fire Nova,Flame Shock,Lava Burst,Lava Lash,Salamander Bite,Fire Blast,Stormstrike\n/cast Flamebound Cleave\n/cast Flame Talon\n/cast Shamanistic Rage\n/cast Flame Ascendance\n/petattack\n/cast Fire Wall', 'Spell_Fire_MoltenBlood', 0, 1786992486, 1787560421, 2, 8, 3, 0, 0),
