(258, '73cfb82d-a496-4163-a05b-7f6612eed28b', '', '', '', 10, 'Haazul', 'Shield Slam Tank', '', '### OVERVIEW\nA shield slam based tank build, revolving around high uptime of shield block and avatar for great damage mitigation.\n\n### ITEMIZATION\n|cffa335ee|Hitem:1168:463:0:0:0:0:0:0:60|h[Skullflame Shield]|h|r is my preferred for the extra threat ticks and good resistances\n\n### ROTATION\nDemoalizing Shout at start of fights\n\nThunderclap for AOE\n\n Revenge and Shield slam are the key pieces, both of which reduce the cooldowns of your mitigation CDs. Hammer the Gap and Recup are woven in where possible to provide armor shred and increase sustain. Revange causes Hammer the gap to aoe, so revenge and hammer prioritize for AOE fights.', 'ability_warrior_criticalblock', 0, 1787001197, 1787001197, 2, 2, 0, 0, 2),
(259, '97ee4da0-df1f-49e1-ad12-53ff4b8684c4', '', '', '', 10, 'Opto', '8k ST DPS TG', '', '### OVERVIEW\n12k+ burst ,  8k dps ST  stronk melee spec\n\n11-12 AOE\n\nshowcase youtube.com/optoe\n\n### PROS_AND_CONS\n|cff1aff1a+not a pet spec\n+pure physical no hybrid shitttt\n+one button rotation\n\n-melee\n-ascension hates melee\n-will probably get nerfed because ascension hates melee despite mediocre dps\n\n### ITEMIZATION\nattackpower/spellpower/str/crit\n\n### ROTATION\nflarestrike>death mark > Slice and dice >bloodbath> charge > CDS > spam macro\n\nflarestrike when you can, its 10 yard min so max melee range to use it. enjoy\n\ngoal is to keep 100% uptime with bloodbath, rotation should allow that unless you miss or get dodged/parried or just no procs.\n\nwindury on main hand/ rock biter off hand\n\n### CONSUMABLES\n|cffa335ee|Hitem:16955:22702:0:0:0:0:0:0:60|h[Judgement Crown]|h|r\n|cffa335ee|Hitem:1381063:0:0:0:0:0:0:0:60|h[Bloodtooth Neck]|h|r\n|cffa335ee|Hitem:213974:22695:0:0:0:0:0:0:60|h[Earthslag Shoulders]|h|r\n|cffa335ee|Hitem:260813:0:0:0:0:0:0:0:60|h[Shroud of Domination]|h|r\n|cffa335ee|Hitem:1392208:928:0:0:0:0:0:0:60|h[Maraudine Breastplate]|h|r\n|cffa335ee|Hitem:16951:927:0:0:0:0:0:0:60|h[Judgement Bindings]|h|r\n|cffa335ee|Hitem:18126:1900:0:0:0:0:0:0:60|h[Infernos, the Extinguished]|h|r\n|cffa335ee|Hitem:218822:1900:0:0:0:0:0:0:60|h[Obsidian Edged Blade]|h|r\n|cffa335ee|Hitem:1392252:0:0:0:0:0:0:0:60|h[Idol to Hakkar]|h|r\n|cffa335ee|Hitem:249554:927:0:0:0:0:0:0:60|h[Death Grips]|h|r\n|cffa335ee|Hitem:19137:0:0:0:0:0:0:0:60|h[Onslaught Girdle]|h|r\n|cffa335ee|Hitem:16954:22702:0:0:0:0:0:0:60|h[Judgement Legplates]|h|r\n|cffa335ee|Hitem:246396:1887:0:0:0:0:0:0:60|h[Coal Miner Boots]|h|r\n|cffa335ee|Hitem:18821:0:0:0:0:0:0:0:60|h[Quick Strike Ring]|h|r\n|cffa335ee|Hitem:1414521:0:0:0:0:0:0:0:60|h[Azerothian Diamond Ring]|h|r\n|cffa335ee|Hitem:18216:0:0:0:0:0:0:0:60|h[Neltharion\'s Badge]|h|r\n|cffa335ee|Hitem:1381105:0:0:0:0:0:0:0:60|h[Faulty Stone Golem]|h|r\n\nnot bis but what i had at the time\n\n### MACROS\nSpam macro:\n\n{HT}showtooltip\n/castsequence reset=4 bloodthirst, slam,execute, slam\n/startattack\n\nCDs:\n{HT}showtooltip\n/cast deathwish\n/cast gurubashi rage\n/cast warcry', 'spell_holy_blessingofstrength', 3, 1787006454, 1787420032, 2, 8, 0, 0, 0),
