(268, '70f5f47d-b483-4abf-94b6-2e5d88f823de', '', '', '', 10, 'Idum', 'Idum\'s Crypt Ranger', '', '### OVERVIEW\nWell this used to be a Necromancer casting class.\nthen i noticed it isn\'t realy that good slow and "Soulless".\nThen came Dark Ranger in my mind.\nNot realy a good idee to make a A52 Dark ranger here didn\'t work.\nThen came the idee what if i mix those 2 togetter, BAM, the Crypt Ranger.\nAnd that is the theory of Class Pairing.\n\n### PROS_AND_CONS\n|cff1aff1a+Strong AoE|r\n+Controll lot\'s of pets.\n+DoT\'s keep the damage going\n\n-Mana depletion\n-Squishy\n-Not an easy build\n\n### ITEMIZATION\nMystic Enchant Order\n---------------------------\nEpic: Necromancer\'s Touch -> Darkwing Volley <=> Widowmaker <=> March of the Dead\nrare: Shadow Shot -> Blood Arrow -> Sjadow Atillery -> Plaguebringer -> Twisted Mind \nGreen: Grave Ammunition -> Glyph of Icy Touch -> Frozen Grave -> Unholy Command\n\nStats Order\n--------------\nHit Rating 14% (-1% Heroic Presence ,-3% Carefull Aim) -> Attack Power -> Critical Strike Rating => Agility -> Spell Power -> Intellect\n\n### ROTATION\nSingle Target\n-----------------\n\nThis build is aboud DoT effects so applied Frost Fever to your targets with Ict Touch first.\nThis allows your to increase the damage of your next Icy Touch thanks to Frozen Grave, because all your other spells are Shadow.\nFollow up with Shadow Shot to applied Corruption, Blood Arrow and Black Arrow.\nBlack Arrow is also inportant to be active on the higherst healted charecter, it lowers your cooldown of Summon Gargoyle, with the Darkwing Volley enchant, means summon it when able.\nSpend overflowing rage with Grave Coil, Necromancer Touch helps increasing that damage, and fill further up if posable with Shadow Shot.\n\nAoE\n-----\nAoE is a different kind of fight.\nDead and Decay is best way to consume your Rune\'s here first, if it is on Cooldown Consume it on Icy Touch.\nFrost Fever got a 25% chance to give your Grave Shot, doing 50% Weapon damage as shadowfrost damage to all targets 8 yards around your target.\nWe also have a LME spell called Shadow Artillery a masive shadow aoe that targets an enemt and all around, level a 4-6 sec soace between it so the DoT can do it\'s job .\nRage can also be consumed here with, fun spell, Corpse Explotion, just make sure the enemys are huminoud or beasts.\nand of course use Black Arrow on the highst health target and summon your Gargoyle as posable.\n\nCooldowns\n--------------\nThis is a Necromancer build, Army of the Dead is a good cooldown for boss fights, but it will also taunt te target use it well, if you are not sure ask te tank before battle\n\nPet\'s\n------\nUndead, woch one your like doesn\'t matter it just need to increase the stacks of Necromancer Touch.\nif you use Caster Undead, they use mana you can replace the last to tallents, "Go for the Trought" with someting else to increase your own damage', 'ability_warlock_cremation', 3, 1787121889, 1787921697, 1, 8, 1, 0, 2),
(269, '2d776ab9-85cc-4404-86f9-d0a8d3468b32', '', '', '', 10, 'Idum', 'Idum\'s Waterspeaker', '', '### OVERVIEW\ntest, Cleanse Spirit cost no points atm, is a bugg made a ticked for it', 'ability_shaman_multitotemactivation', 1, 1787125780, 1787125780, 1, 4, 4, 0, 0),
(270, 'd6a278f5-42f5-4ed6-88cb-f501830cc155', '', '', '', 10, 'Reg', 'Bloody Blademaster', '', '### OVERVIEW\nExecute, Mortal Strike and Death strike being your main Dps/Threat buttons. With Ghostly Strike and Riposte being your Defensive buttons.\n\n   I Like to charge in Ghostly Strike,Execute if its up then cycle between it and Death strike and then Mortal strike to get the master of arms proc. Slice and dice and Recuperate as needed. \n\n   Plaugebringer to apply diseases and Pestilance to keep them up and spreading.(DONT LET THEM GO DOWN OR YOU HAVE TO WAIT FOR HTE COOL DOWN OF PLAUGEBRINGER TO COME UP.)\n\n### PROS_AND_CONS\nGreat solo build. not sure how good it is in any other enviroment.\n\n### ITEMIZATION\nWIP\n\n### ROTATION\nSee above\n\n### CONSUMABLES\nSee above\n\n### MACROS\nWIP\n\n### WEAKAURAS\nWIP\n\n### NOTES\nif you dont die you cant lose.', 'ability_iyyokuk_sword_red', 1, 1787143448, 1787143448, 2, 2, 0, 0, 2),
(271, '1cb70a8d-4a4f-4b75-9171-f1949c50911e', '', '', '', 10, 'Idum', 'Idum\'s Fallen Knight', '', '### OVERVIEW\nPaladins fallen in the against the Scourge, never forggoten their Duties and risen back up.\nWith revenge for their fallen comrads that they can command along side them.\nThe bone\'s of their friends to protect them will make them undieing.\nA Paladin Knight, no a Fallen Knight.\n\nUpdate: Addit Mastery Bonusses, was forgotten.\n\n### PROS_AND_CONS\n|cff1aff1a+Good selfhealing |r\n+Lots of damage reductions buffs.\n+Good AoE threat\n\n-Time for threatbuilding\n-Slow movement\n-Long CD on interupt\n\n### ITEMIZATION\nMystic Enchant order\n---------------------------\nEpic: Blademaster -> Blood Shield -> Skeleton King -> Judged Infection\nRare; Holy Siphon -> Bone Toss -> Runic contagion -> Plaguebringer -> Abomination\'s Limb\nGreen:  Runic Defence -> Glyph of Disease -> Glyph of Rune Strike -> Glyph of Bone Shield -> Aegis -> Crimson Ward\n\nStats Order\n--------------\nHit Rating 8% (-1% Heroic Presence) -> Defence Rating (Parry/Block/Dodge) -> Critical Strike Rating ->Shield Block Value -> Stamina -> Strenght\n\n### ROTATION\nActivate your Ghoul, he will reduce your damage taken with 5% and increases your damage done with 5%\nApplie your Diseases with Icy Touch and Plague Strike.\nkeep those active with Pestilence, this also spread them.\nConsume your blood runes in sequence Pestilence and Heartstrike if known, to trigger Bladed Barrier.\nActivate Bone Shield if Known, Use Death Pact if HP gets lower or 1 Bone Shield remaining this will activate Skeleton King and refresh your Bone Shield charges. (A* see additional Notes)\nFor the rest consume your remaining Frost, Unholy or Death Runes with Death Strike to selfheal and Vlademaster proc makes that AoE what also heals your for that AoE damage.\nJudgement of Light on your main target and for optial selfhealing use Seal of Light.\nLosing Threat out of Pesteline range, use your Bone Toss or Avanger Shield, Avanger Shield works alos well later on to interupt targets spellcasting.\nRage will be consumed with Rune Strike macro\'d within your moste used attacks, because it doesn\'t have a Global Cooldown.\nnow the moste fun part to consume overcharged rage, Corps Explotion, use it once you have a few kills in a bigg AoE pull and watch the bones and flesh lying around.\n\nLooks much but is actualy quiet easy to play once you have the hang of it.\n\n### MACROS\nNo GBC macro\n-------------------\n{HT}Showtooltip\n/cast <moste used skill>\n/cast Rune Strike\n\n\nLots of spell usage\n-----------------------\n{HT}showtooltip\n/castsequence reset=<sec> Skill1, Skill2 ......\n\n### NOTES\nBuggs\n--------\nA: Made a report for Skeleton King, it once worked well but now it doesn\'t anymore, doesn\'t refresh your Bone Shield, nor give it the HP buff, but doesn\'t kill your minion.', 'ability_rogue_plunderarmor', 3, 1787149254, 1787391435, 1, 2, 0, 0, 0),
(272, 'b4893079-c678-43e7-b358-980cebc97254', '', '', '', 10, 'Moghadina', 'retaliator - passive dmg test', '', '### OVERVIEW\ntest', 'Ability_Creature_Cursed_04', 0, 1787157876, 1787157876, 2, 8, 0, 0, 0),
(273, 'd783f070-2a8d-4442-9ebc-19342c547201', '', '', '', 10, 'Itscammy', 'aoe tank', '', '### OVERVIEW\naoe tank build', 'Interface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_QuestionMark', 0, 1787181563, 1787181563, 2, 8, 0, 0, 0),
(274, '5d6104ac-c73a-41c6-b4bc-55b8882e89e4', '', '', '', 10, 'Gutfor', 'Dungeon Spellcleave Monster', '', '### OVERVIEW\n- This build has big damage on both ST and AOE\n- Monster m+ spec for damage & utility\n- Brings totem utility + bloodlust\n\nHow this works:\n\n- Chain lightning to gain stacks\n- Press earth shock for mega damage\n- Thunderstorm on cooldown for mana (Resets with casts)\n- Elemental mastery on cooldown (Resets with casts)\n- At 25 stacks earth shock will hit for 70-80k \n- Earthquake proc\'s stacks as well use it on CD \n\nCooldowns:\n\n- Fire Ascendance\n- Elemental mastery\n- Fire elemental totem\n- Bloodlust\n- Totem utilities (Tremor, grounding, resists, etc..)\n\nBuffs:\n\n- Demonic mind \n- Flametongue weapon x2\n\nPet:\n\n- Use an elemental that provides 5% damage or air ele for 5% haste or fire tele 5% hit rating\n\nTotems:\n\n- Use the AIO "Call of the Elements" (Drops all 4)\n- Tremor / Totem of Wrath / Mana spring or healing stream / Wrath of Air totem', 'Spell_Arcane_MindMastery', 1, 1787190720, 1787220465, 2, 8, 3, 0, 0),
(275, '51a9dd7d-7e13-460d-8ef9-c1dd46ebfa20', '', '', '', 10, 'Shashael', 'jeb_GrooveHeal-V2', '', '### OVERVIEW\nwip', 'Ability_Druid_Replenish', 0, 1787209946, 1787209946, 2, 4, 1, 0, 0);
