(303, '8ece77a5-35ea-4f22-9d49-2db3e6459d2c', '', '', '', 10, 'Raggendor', 'Chain Lightning Spammer up to 20k cleave', '', '### OVERVIEW\nTake Fire elemental for 5% Crit and Hit\n\n### PROS_AND_CONS\n|cff1aff1a+Great Cleave DMG |r                     +good AOE                   +easy to play                                                                                                                                                                         -Raltatively low ST dmg compared to cleave and aoe\n\n### ITEMIZATION\nHit > SpellPen > Crit > SP > Int (pref int+spirit gear due to crit gain from spirit with Molten Armor) > Haste\n\n### NOTES\nMy highest Earth shock Crit was 62k with this at 64ilvl', 'ability_vehicle_electrocharge', 0, 1787460676, 1787460676, 2, 8, 0, 0, 1),
