(316, '6eb9b5fb-4b12-4792-a370-53f579bf0ca4', '', '', '', 10, 'Reg', 'Warcraft 3 Paladin', '', '### OVERVIEW\nWIP\n\n### PROS_AND_CONS\nok at everything great at nothing.\n\n### ITEMIZATION\nWIP\n\n### ROTATION\nWIP\n\n### CONSUMABLES\nWIP\n\n### MACROS\nWIP\n\n### WEAKAURAS\nWIP', 'ability_mount_charger', 0, 1787511473, 1787511473, 2, 2, 0, 0, 3),
