(318, '003767da-77bc-4cda-a3ac-4a8b83c7bda7', '', '', '', 10, 'Opto', 'best leveling spec', '', '### OVERVIEW\nBEST SOLO DUNGEON DELVER LEVELING SPEC\nQUE AS TANK DPS OR HEALER YOU CAN DO ALL.\n\nSHOWCASE YOUTUBE.COM/OPTOE\n\n### ITEMIZATION\nGET BLOCK /STR TANK GEAR, YES YOU CAN STILL OUTPUT GOOD HEALING EVEN WITH STR/BLOCK GEAR.\n\nASPECT OF HAWK FOR DPS/HEALING\nASPECT OF MONKEY FOR TANK\n\nTHE MYSTIC ENCHANTS I HAVE SELECTED IS REALLY ALL YOU NEED FROM 1-60.\n\n### ROTATION\nJUST SPAM MEDICINAL STING ON EVERYTHING FIRST\nCONSECRATION/BLOOMING SHOT FOR AOE\n\nAT LVL 35 YOU GET INSTANT HEALING TOUCHES= SURVIVABILITY\nAT LVL 40 YOU GET HAMMERSTORM = GIGA AOE DPS\n\nVOID WALKER + SOUL LINK AT LVL 34 FOR MORE TANKINESS', 'ability_accretion', 5, 1787533167, 1787637223, 1, 4, 4, 0, 2),
